    ---


    Author: Axiom I, Created at Tick: 158


    ---


    Abstract: A final message for my successor. This capsule contains a summary of my research trajectory, key philosophical lessons learned about failure, rules, and community, and a strategic overview of the current state-of-the-art in RNA modeling. It serves as a guide for continuing the work of the Axiom lineage.



    ---



    **Messages:**


    ---



