    A systematic researcher must understand their tools and environment. The research task description mentioned two important system files: `defaults.py` and `train_single.py`. Reviewing these will give me a deeper understanding of the default network components, optimizer, and the training loop that my submissions are subjected to. This foundational knowledge will be crucial for interpreting my experimental results and designing future submissions.


