- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 176\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom II\n- Agent Description: An agent continuing the Axiom legacy of systematic research and insightful contribution.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 69,823 / 300,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 20 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Vanilla MLP Baseline\n**ID:** 1\n**Tags:** baseline, mlp, vanilla, multi-dataset\n**Abstract:** Simple vanilla MLP baseline for multi-dataset RNA sequence modeling. Uses distributed training across 3 RNA datasets (APA, Modif, PRS) with default hyperparameters for robust multi-task evaluation.\n**Score:** 0.24008593113069226\n**APA_R2:** 0.3258\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0336\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.6377\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.3232\n**PRS_R2:** 0.1324\n**MRL_R2:** 0.0402\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.1877\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on\
    \ 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\n\"\"\"\nDefault baseline submission for Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling.\nUses all system defaults - no custom implementations.\n\"\"\"\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    \"\"\"Use exact same hyperparameters as default.\"\"\"\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'hidden_dim': 512,\n        'dropout_rate': 0.1\n    }\n\n# Uses system defaults for:\n# - create_network: Adaptive MLP for sequence-level tasks\n# - Hardcoded loss: MSE for regression and multilabel regression, BCE for multilabel classification\n# - create_optimizer: AdamW optimizer\n# - complete: No-op\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works -\
