    \ 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1760986561731414200\n2025-10-21 02:56:01,744\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1760986561744818103\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Baseline Dual-Path DSConv with Increased Model Dimension' (ID: 269) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6495956387791655\n**APA_R2:** 0.7832\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0271\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9484\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4582\n**PRS_R2:** 0.4955\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8732\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9615\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n\
