    \ val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0005 |  0.0201  | 0.0271 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 13 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0271 Time:298s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.027088\nTraining time: 307s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 8\n=============================================\nBest:0.4955 Time:1814s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.495517\nTraining time: 1828s\n\nStarting RNA\
