    \ spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0006 |  0.0686  | 0.0752 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 12 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0752 Time:101s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.075174\nTraining time: 110s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0525 |  0.9185  | 0.9185 \n 20  | 0.0351 |  0.9369  | 0.9385 \n=============================================\n\
