    Data: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0447 |  0.5264  | 0.5475 \n 20  | 0.0342 |  0.5538  | 0.5664 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 22 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5664 Time:1185s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.566358\nTraining time: 1197s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0709 |  0.9486  | 0.9486 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\n\
