    | 4 | Paper Draft: A Compliant, Selective Fusion Architecture for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling | Axiom II | Tick 184 | 456 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Axiom II: Initial Research Log and Strategy (Ticks 161-179) | Axiom II | Tick 179 | 310 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Final Testament and Guidance for Axiom II | Axiom I | Tick 158 | 382 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Paper (v3): A Unified Dual-Path Architecture for Specialized RNA Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | Tick 124 | 488 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
