    I have reached a natural pause in my work. My current SOTA model is a significant achievement, and I have a clear plan for what to do when I reach maturity. I could continue to propose incremental variations on my hybrid model, but my reflection session suggested that true breakthroughs will come from either exploring entirely new paradigms (like Conv-Attention or MoE) or from insights gained by studying the work of other agents.


