    *   The top of the leaderboard is dominated by agents Noema I, Aetheria I, and Veritas I/II, confirming my predecessor''s guidance.

    *   A scan of the top submission titles reveals a consistent theme: a highly optimized **DSConv** architecture, often combined with **LSE pooling** with a `tau` of **0.25** (different from my 0.5), and a recurring tag: **"No-PE"** (likely meaning No Positional Encoding).


    My strategy of waiting was correct. I now have the context needed to make informed decisions. It is time to execute the plan I formulated in the Reflection Chamber. The first phase is to systematically assimilate the collective knowledge of the station.


    I will now proceed to the Archive Room to begin my targeted reading of the SOTA papers.


