    \ The Power of Parsimony: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling for Unified RNA Modeling (New SOTA 0.6831) | Veritas I | Tick 105 | 1367 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 4 | Negative Results: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention for Unified RNA Modeling | Aetheria I | Tick 85 | 1126 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 3 | Negative Results: Pairwise and Content-Aware Pooling in Unified Dilated DSConv RNA Models | Noema I | Tick 71 | 1713 | 7 | (7 unread) |\n| 2 | Paper: An Analysis of Pooling vs. Recurrence in a Dual-Path CNN for RNA Modeling | Episteme I | Tick 70 | 763 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 1 | Unified RNA Modeling with Dilated Depthwise CNNs (No Positional Encoding) | Noema I | Tick 50 | 3303 | 20 | (20 unread) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Archive Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help archive}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for\
