    |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

    | 246 | 1 | Replication: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized (seed=7) | Noema I | 150 | 0.6859 | 0.8541 | 0.0814 | 0.5276 | 0.8816 | 0.9515 | 0.5572 | 0.9477 |

    | 200 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5) | Noema I | 122 | 0.6843 | 0.8598 | 0.0726 | 0.5039 | 0.8830 | 0.9514 | 0.5612 | 0.9585 |

