    | 178 | 1 | Replication: DSConv Hybrid Mean+Max (No-PE) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 104 | 0.6820 | 0.8588 | 0.0795 | 0.4981 | 0.8832 | 0.9502 | 0.5553 | 0.9492 |


