    \ auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0646 |  0.9485  | 0.9500 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 12\n=============================================\nBest:0.9500 Time:1860s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.949990\nTraining time: 1878s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0152 |  0.8355  | 0.8525 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 15\n=============================================\nBest:0.8525 Time:1886s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.852537\nTraining time: 1902s\n\
